6,Musical aesthetics in the French Antilles and French Guiana,https://www.auxsons.com/en/focus/musical-aesthetics-in-the-french-antilles-and-french-guiana/,"French Antillean music is sometimes presented solely through the prism of the professed skin colour of its performers. Some are said to be plainly ""black""; others more ""mulatto"" or mixed. In either case, it is to knowingly ignore the crucible of Creole cultures - a human cataclysm of appalling violence but astonishing fecundity.",Lesser Antillean French Creole,Creole
7,Zouk Excellence & Partying in the Lesser Antilles,https://kxlu.com/2026/03/04/zouk-excellence/,"With zouk featuring the Antillean Creole spoken in Guadeloupe (which differs significantly from the mainland French dialect), it allowed those people, who were alienated from both their places of ethnic origin in Africa and their colonizing country, to form a proud culture of their own.",Lesser Antillean French Creole,Creole
